            "source:629ec7a501a3ec60825fe144",
            "source:f4618f5359dd9516280c2ab0"
          ],
          "text": "Auchenai Soulpriests warn intruders not to disturb sleeping spirits and threaten death for violating their resting place. In combat, they use shadow magic and Falter.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18493
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
